# Copy to .env.local to override. All values are optional.
#
# By default IrisBlink downloads the MediaPipe WASM runtime from jsDelivr and the
# face-landmarker model from Google's model storage the first time you start a scan.
# That means the app is NOT fully offline by default.
#
# To self-host both (no third-party requests at scan time), run `npm run vendor:mediapipe`
# (needs internet once) and then set the two values below.

# VITE_MEDIAPIPE_WASM_URL=./mediapipe/wasm
# VITE_FACE_MODEL_URL=./models/face_landmarker.task
